<item>
<title>Home</title>
<link>https://www.theapplepi.org/home/</link>
<pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
<dc:creator><![CDATA[pi-editor]]></dc:creator>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.theapplepi.org/index.html</guid>
<description></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:group {"align":"full","style":{"color":{"background":"#0873d0"}},"layout":{"type":"constrained"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-group alignfull has-background" style="background-color:#0873d0">
<!-- wp:image {"align":"center","sizeSlug":"large"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-large"><img src="https://www.theapplepi.org/uploads/1/4/5/6/145684944/editor/macbook-1-67_6.jpg?1688047283" alt="Picture"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:group -->

<!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns">
<!-- wp:column {"width":"50%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:50%"><!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"left"} -->
<p><strong><span style="color:#5040ae;font-size:1.35rem">Who We Are:</span></strong> The Washington Apple Pi, or simply the Pi, is a community designed to improve every member’s  knowledge and enjoyment of Apple products, and to do so in a way that respects varying levels of technical expertise and comfort with technology.<br>We accomplish this through:</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:list -->
<ul class="wp-block-list"><li>Regular presentations by technology subject matter experts</li><li>A variety of informal opportunities where members can communicate, teach and learn</li><li>On-going relationships with other user groups, and</li><li>Occasional face-to-face and virtual social activities</li></ul>
<!-- /wp:list -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"left"} -->
<p>The Pi also looks to the future by sponsoring a student scholarship at the George Mason University in the field of Information Technology.<br>The Pi has been around for more than 45 years, far longer than most personal computer organizations, and many computer companies.  Pi members have years and years of experience. They understand and appreciate the history of Mac personal computing, willingly help others get the most productivity and enjoyment from their Apple products, and put the glimpses into the future of personal computing and automation technology into perspective. We would love to have you join us.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"textAlign":"center","style":{"color":{"text":"#5040ae"}}} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-color has-text-align-center" style="color:#5040ae"><span style="color:#5040ae">Become a Member</span></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/join-the-pi/">Join the Pi</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column {"width":"50%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:50%"><!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"center"} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center"><span style="color:#5040ae"><strong><span style="font-size:1.9rem"><a href="/general-meetings/">Our Next General Meeting</a></span><br><span style="font-size:1.35rem">​September 26, 2026</span></strong></span></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"custom"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image alignright size-large"><a href="https://www.theapplepi.org/uploads/1/4/5/6/145684944/september_2026_aaron_davis.jpg"><img src="https://www.theapplepi.org/uploads/1/4/5/6/145684944/september-2026-aaron-davis_orig.jpg" alt="Picture"/></a></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"center"} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center"><strong><span style="color:#5040ae">​What&#x27;s New From Apple!</span></strong></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"center"} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center"><strong><span style="color:#5040ae;font-size:1.9rem">And Upcoming...</span></strong></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong><span style="color:#5040ae">​Our October General Meeting will be on October 24, 2026. Members, see groups.io Messages and Calendar.</span></strong></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"center"} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center"><strong><span style="color:#5040ae;font-size:1.9rem"><a href="/general-meetings/">Earlier General Meetings</a></span></strong></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:columns -->]]></content:encoded>
<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
