<item>
<title>Clubhouse Saturday</title>
<link>https://www.theapplepi.org/clubhouse-saturday/</link>
<pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
<dc:creator><![CDATA[pi-editor]]></dc:creator>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.theapplepi.org/clubhouse-saturday.html</guid>
<description></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"textAlign":"center","style":{"color":{"text":"#5040ae"}}} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-color has-text-align-center" style="color:#5040ae"><span style="color:#5040ae;font-size:2.4rem">Clubhouse Saturday</span></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Clubhouse Saturday sessions are held on the 1st and 3rd Saturdays of each month via Zoom. These regularly scheduled sessions are more informal than our General Meeting and present members with the opportunity to solve problems and learn new things together. Having some issues following a Mac OS update? Wondering whether you should install the newest iOS release? Seeing some strange behavior with your email program? Just want to see if you can stump the other members? Clubhouse Saturday is your place. Come with your questions, come with your answers. <br><br>Like other Pi gatherings, Clubhouse Saturday meetings are posted to the <strong><a href="https://applepi.groups.io/g/main/calendar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pi calendar</a> </strong>(members only) and announced by specific <strong><a href="https://applepi.groups.io/g/main/topics" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">postings on groups.io</a></strong> (members only) which generate emails to those choosing to receive them. Details and member access information for the Clubhouse sessions are in the postings and the emails.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
<wp:post_id>149</wp:post_id>
<wp:post_date>2026-09-22 12:00:00</wp:post_date>
<wp:post_date_gmt>2026-09-22 16:00:00</wp:post_date_gmt>
<wp:post_modified>2026-09-22 12:00:00</wp:post_modified>
<wp:post_modified_gmt>2026-09-22 16:00:00</wp:post_modified_gmt>
<wp:comment_status>closed</wp:comment_status>
<wp:ping_status>closed</wp:ping_status>
<wp:post_name>clubhouse-saturday</wp:post_name>
