</item>
<item>
<title>Thursday Learners</title>
<link>https://www.theapplepi.org/thursday-learners/</link>
<pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
<dc:creator><![CDATA[pi-editor]]></dc:creator>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.theapplepi.org/thursday-learners.html</guid>
<description></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"textAlign":"center","style":{"color":{"text":"#5040ae"}}} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-color has-text-align-center" style="color:#5040ae"><span style="color:#5040ae;font-size:2.4rem">Thursday Learners Sessions</span></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns">
<!-- wp:column {"width":"50%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:50%"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The second Thursday of each month at 1:00 ET presents a learning opportunity for Pi members who have joined the Afternoon Learners Special Interest Group (and any member can join). Attendees gather online to hear about a specific pre-announced tech topic or two. A Pi member might present a demo of new Mac or IOS software, explain how to use a &quot;hidden&quot; iPhone or HomePod feature, or provide an informal review of some piece of tech gear. There is always something to learn and plenty of time for questions and the occasional answer. Don&#x27;t be surprised if the discussion goes beyond the announced topic. Actually, be surprised if it doesn&#x27;t.<br><br>Like other Pi gatherings, the Thursday Learners group meetings are posted to the <strong><a href="https://applepi.groups.io/g/main/calendar" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pi calendar</a></strong> (members only) and announced by specific <strong><a href="https://applepi.groups.io/g/main/topics" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">postings on groups.io</a></strong> (members only) which generate emails to those choosing to receive them. Details and member access information for the Thursday Learners sessions are in the postings and the emails.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column {"width":"50%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:50%"><!-- wp:image {"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"custom"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-large"><img src="https://www.theapplepi.org/uploads/1/4/5/6/145684944/pi-alsig-logo_orig.jpeg" alt="Picture"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:columns -->]]></content:encoded>
<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
<wp:post_id>151</wp:post_id>
<wp:post_date>2026-09-22 12:00:00</wp:post_date>
<wp:post_date_gmt>2026-09-22 16:00:00</wp:post_date_gmt>
<wp:post_modified>2026-09-22 12:00:00</wp:post_modified>
<wp:post_modified_gmt>2026-09-22 16:00:00</wp:post_modified_gmt>
<wp:comment_status>closed</wp:comment_status>
<wp:ping_status>closed</wp:ping_status>
<wp:post_name>thursday-learners</wp:post_name>
<wp:status>publish</wp:status>
<wp:post_parent>0</wp:post_parent>
