<item>
<title>Join the Pi</title>
<link>https://www.theapplepi.org/join-the-pi/</link>
<pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
<dc:creator><![CDATA[pi-editor]]></dc:creator>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.theapplepi.org/join-the-pi.html</guid>
<description></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"textAlign":"center","style":{"color":{"text":"#5040ae"}}} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-color has-text-align-center" style="color:#5040ae"><span style="color:#5040ae"><span style="font-size:2.4rem">J</span>oin Us -- It&#x27;s as Easy as Pi</span></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:image {"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"custom"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-large"><img src="https://www.theapplepi.org/uploads/1/4/5/6/145684944/editor/chain-4049725-1280.jpg?1694720570" alt="Picture"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns">
<!-- wp:column {"width":"56.003752345216%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:56.003752345216%"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><span style="font-size:1.9rem">Step 1:</span> <span style="font-size:1.35rem">Join the Pi.</span><br>Click the <strong><span style="color:#b748ae">Join the Pi</span></strong> button to go to our Using Join It page and follow the Join the Pi instructions for establishing an account with our membership provider, Join It. Only $25 for a year.<br>Not quite ready? Click the <strong><span style="color:#b748ae">Why Should I</span></strong> button and prepare to be overwhelmed with reasons.<br>Join It is where you will maintain your membership account and renew your membership. <a href="/using-join-it/"><strong>Click here</strong> </a>to handle these and other tasks.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column {"width":"43.996247654784%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:43.996247654784%"><!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/using-join-it/">1. Join the Pi</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/why-join-the-pi/">Why Should I?</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:columns -->

<!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns">
<!-- wp:column {"width":"56.003752345216%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:56.003752345216%"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><span style="font-size:1.9rem">Step 2:</span> <span style="font-size:1.35rem">Establish a groups.io account.</span><br>The welcome email will invite you to register with groups.io and then (in Step 3) request access to the Pi group. Click the <strong><span style="color:#b748ae">Register with groups.io</span></strong> button to go to our Using groups.io page and follow the instructions to Create a groups.io account. Or, click <strong><span style="color:#b748ae">Another Account, Really?</span></strong> to learn why you should.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column {"width":"43.996247654784%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:43.996247654784%"><!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/using-groupsio/">2.Register with groups.io</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/why-join-groupsio/">Another Account, really?</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:columns -->

<!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns">
<!-- wp:column {"width":"55.722326454034%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:55.722326454034%"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><span style="font-size:1.9rem">Step 3:</span> <span style="font-size:1.35rem">Request Access to the Pi group</span><br>Now, click the <strong><span style="color:#b748ae">Request Access to the PI</span></strong> button and then follow the instructions to Request access to the Pi pages on groups.io. You will only do this once.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column {"width":"44.277673545966%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:44.277673545966%"><!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/using-groupsio/">3. Request Access to the Pi</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:columns -->

<!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns">
<!-- wp:column {"width":"55.722326454034%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:55.722326454034%"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><span style="font-size:1.9rem">Step 4: </span><span style="font-size:1.35rem">Patience, grasshopper</span><br>It may take a day or two for your request to be approved (we are volunteers, after all). After you receive the approval email, click the <strong><span style="color:#b748ae">Access groups.io</span></strong> button, follow the instructions to Access and navigate Pi pages on groups.io, and let the interaction, sharing, and learning begin. Welcome to the Pi!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column {"width":"44.277673545966%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:44.277673545966%"><!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/patience/">Don&#x27;t Click Here While Waiting</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons -->

<!-- wp:buttons {"layout":{"type":"flex","justifyContent":"center"}} -->
<div class="wp-block-buttons"><!-- wp:button -->
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="/using-groupsio/">4. Access groups.io</a></div>
<!-- /wp:button --></div>
<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:columns -->]]></content:encoded>
<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
<wp:post_id>162</wp:post_id>
<wp:post_date>2026-09-22 12:00:00</wp:post_date>
<wp:post_date_gmt>2026-09-22 16:00:00</wp:post_date_gmt>
<wp:post_modified>2026-09-22 12:00:00</wp:post_modified>
<wp:post_modified_gmt>2026-09-22 16:00:00</wp:post_modified_gmt>
