<item>
<title>The Pi Board</title>
<link>https://www.theapplepi.org/the-pi-board/</link>
<pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
<dc:creator><![CDATA[pi-editor]]></dc:creator>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.theapplepi.org/the-pi-board.html</guid>
<description></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"textAlign":"center","style":{"color":{"text":"#5040ae"}}} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-color has-text-align-center" style="color:#5040ae"><span style="color:#5040ae">Washington Apple Pi Governance</span></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><strong><span style="color:#5040ae;font-size:1.35rem">2026-2027 Board of Directors:</span></strong><br>An election for the Pi Board is held annually in May. Board members are elected to a three-year term and members can run for re-election at the completion of their term. The current Board members are:<br><span style="color:#5040ae"><strong>Jon Bernstein, Event Chair</strong><br><strong>Bruce Brown<br>Tim Childers<br>Jim Diamond<br>Gabe Goldberg<br>​Craig Jobbins. President<br>Larry Kerschberg, Secretary<br>Diana King<br>Raju Tonapi<br>Roy Wagner. Treasurer<br>Van Zeck</strong></span></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p><span style="color:#5040ae;font-size:1.35rem"><strong>Washington Apple Pi By-laws:</strong></span><br>Click the .pdf file below to view and optionally download a copy of the Apple Pi By-laws. Then use your browser Back button to return to this page.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:file -->
<div class="wp-block-file"><a href="https://www.theapplepi.org/uploads/1/4/5/6/145684944/2021-02-26_pi_bylaws_final_version.pdf">Pi By-laws 2021-02-26.pdf</a><a href="https://www.theapplepi.org/uploads/1/4/5/6/145684944/2021-02-26_pi_bylaws_final_version.pdf" class="wp-block-file__button" download>Download</a></div>
<!-- /wp:file -->]]></content:encoded>
<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
<wp:post_id>167</wp:post_id>
<wp:post_date>2026-09-22 12:00:00</wp:post_date>
<wp:post_date_gmt>2026-09-22 16:00:00</wp:post_date_gmt>
<wp:post_modified>2026-09-22 12:00:00</wp:post_modified>
<wp:post_modified_gmt>2026-09-22 16:00:00</wp:post_modified_gmt>
