<item>
<title>Volunteer</title>
<link>https://www.theapplepi.org/volunteer/</link>
<pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 12:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
<dc:creator><![CDATA[pi-editor]]></dc:creator>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.theapplepi.org/volunteer.html</guid>
<description></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"textAlign":"center"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center">Volunteer</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:columns -->
<div class="wp-block-columns">
<!-- wp:column {"width":"58.630393996248%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:58.630393996248%"><!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>One thing&#x27;s for sure. You know more about technology than somebody; or maybe you know more about how technology doesn&#x27;t work than the next person; or maybe you have the knack of asking that question others were thinking of; or your administrative skills are legendary (at least in your own mind); or you always wanted to work on a website; or you are really interested in learning more about Apple hardware and software; or you would just love the opportunity to work with, teach, and learn from others. In any of these (and dozens more) describe you, you are a perfect candidate for a Pi volunteer position. Experts celebrated, but NOT needed. It can be so rewarding to become a part of something and make a difference.<br><br>The Pi routinely has openings for those willing to be part of the Pi Board, serving in official positions in the Pi organization, and hosting virtual  sessions for members--structured, unstructured, even chaotic, but always helpful and enjoyable. Have something (anything?) to offer? The Pi and its members can, pardon the expression, take advantage of you!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->

<!-- wp:column {"width":"41.369606003752%"} -->
<div class="wp-block-column" style="flex-basis:41.369606003752%"><!-- wp:image {"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"custom"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-large"><img src="https://www.theapplepi.org/uploads/1/4/5/6/145684944/handshake-3962172-1280_orig.jpg" alt="Picture"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image --></div>
<!-- /wp:column -->
</div>
<!-- /wp:columns -->]]></content:encoded>
<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
<wp:post_id>174</wp:post_id>
