<item>
<title>Recap: 8/24/24 General Meeting</title>
<link>https://www.theapplepi.org/blog/recap-92824-meeting</link>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Aug 2024 12:00:00 -0400</pubDate>
<dc:creator><![CDATA[pi-editor]]></dc:creator>
<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.theapplepi.org/blog/recap-92824-meeting</guid>
<description></description>
<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Many thanks to the Pi members who attended our August General Meeting!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:image {"sizeSlug":"large","linkDestination":"custom"} -->
<figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-large"><img src="https://www.theapplepi.org/uploads/1/4/5/6/145684944/aug-meeting-recap-blog-image-orig_orig.png" alt="Picture"/></figure>
<!-- /wp:image -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"align":"left"} -->
<p>With a talk titled, Beyond the Pale Blue Dot: The Hunt for Habitable Exoplanets, Sarah Al-Ahmed gave a so interesting presentation about trends in exoplanet hunting, and she addressed many other space topics in a far-ranging Q&amp;A. <br>She started with the story of the pale blue dot, and here, you&#x27;ll find the wonderful Carl Sagan video,<strong><span style="color:#5040ae"> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tgQ1PtkZvGU" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tgQ1PtkZvGU</a></span></strong><br>Al Ahmed&#x27;s main presentation is on our YouTube page, here, <strong><a href="https://youtube.com/live/gpF2VrLg51Q" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://youtube.com/live/gpF2VrLg51Q</a></strong><br>  Pi Door Prize WInner  : Gene Haddon was the delighted winner of our Pi Door Prize at the meeting - and opted for her first AirTag - so Roy will be sending it.  Congrats Gene!</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->]]></content:encoded>
<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
<wp:post_id>188</wp:post_id>
